        "message": "=**Welcome to Atlas AI!**\n\nHi {{ $('User Signup Webhook').item.json.firstName }},\n\nCongratulations! Your **{{ $json.planName }} Plan** has been successfully activated.\n\n**Account Details:**\n- User ID: {{ $('Initialize User Account').item.json.userId }}\n- Plan: {{ $json.planName }} (${{ $json.monthlyPrice }}/month)\n- Trial Period: 14 days (ends {{ DateTime.fromISO($('Initialize User Account').item.json.trialEndDate).toFormat('MMMM dd, yyyy') }})\n\n**Your Plan Features:**\n{{ $json.planFeatures.contactLimit === -1 ? '✅ Unlimited contacts' : '✅ Up to ' + $json.planFeatures.contactLimit.toLocaleString() + ' contacts' }}\n✅ {{ $json.planFeatures.emailAutomation === 'basic' ? 'Basic' : $json.planFeatures.emailAutomation === 'advanced' ? 'Advanced' : 'Enterprise' }} email automation\n{{ $json.planFeatures.aiCampaignsPerMonth === -1 ? '✅ Unlimited AI campaigns' : '✅ ' + $json.planFeatures.aiCampaignsPerMonth + ' AI-generated campaigns per month' }}\n✅ {{ $json.planFeatures.analyticsLevel === 'standard' ? 'Standard' : $json.planFeatures.analyticsLevel === 'advanced' ? 'Advanced' : 'Predictive' }} analytics dashboard\n✅ {{ $json.planFeatures.supportLevel === 'email' ? 'Email support' : $json.planFeatures.supportLevel === 'priority' ? 'Priority support' : '24/7 phone support' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.teamMembers === -1 ? '✅ Unlimited team members' : '✅ Up to ' + $json.planFeatures.teamMembers + ' team members' }}\n✅ {{ $json.planFeatures.integrations }} integrations\n✅ Mobile app access\n{{ $json.planFeatures.abTesting ? '✅ A/B testing suite' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.customBranding ? '✅ Custom branding' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.leadScoring ? '✅ Lead scoring' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.socialMediaAutomation ? '✅ Social media automation' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.apiAccess ? '✅ API access' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.whiteLabel ? '✅ White-label solutions' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.customAITraining ? '✅ Custom AI model training' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.dedicatedAccountManager ? '✅ Dedicated account manager' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.advancedSecurity ? '✅ Advanced security & compliance' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.customReporting ? '✅ Custom reporting' : '' }}\n\n**Getting Started:**\n1. Complete your profile setup\n2. Import your contacts (limit: {{ $json.planFeatures.contactLimit === -1 ? 'unlimited' : $json.planFeatures.contactLimit }})\n3. Create your first AI-powered campaign\n4. Explore your dashboard features\n\n**Need Help?**\n{{ $json.planFeatures.supportLevel === 'email' ? 'Email: support@atlasai.com' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.supportLevel === 'priority' ? 'Priority Support: priority@atlasai.com' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planFeatures.supportLevel === '24_7_phone' ? 'Phone: +1 (555) 123-4567 (24/7)' : '' }}\n\n**Dashboard Access:**\nhttps://atlasai.com/dashboard?welcome=true\n\nWelcome to the future of AI-powered marketing!\n\nThe Atlas AI Team\n\n---\n*This is an automated message from Atlas AI. Please do not reply to this email.*",
